<h1>1-based indexing</h1>
<p>
(definition)
</p>

<p>
<strong>Definition:</strong>
Indexing (an <a href="array.html"><em>array</em></a>) beginning with 1.
</p>

<p>
<strong>Aggregate parent</strong> (I am a part of or used in ...)<br>
<a href="array.html"><em>array</em></a>.
</p>
<p>
<strong>See also</strong>
<a href="zeroBasedIndexing.html"><em>0-based indexing</em></a>.
</p>

<p>
<em>Note:
That is, an array A with n items is accessed as  A[1], A[2], &hellip;, A[n].</em>
</p>

<p>Author: <a href="../Other/contrib.html#authorPEB">PEB</a></p>

<hr>

